{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02082",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.81,
      "end_seconds": 6.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.15,
      "end_seconds": 12.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.82,
      "end_seconds": 19.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Uh, honestly, it's agitation, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.73,
      "end_seconds": 23.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.82,
      "end_seconds": 29.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Ah, I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.98,
      "end_seconds": 34.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.95,
      "end_seconds": 38.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.26,
      "end_seconds": 41.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.3,
      "end_seconds": 57.86,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "It usually comes with vomiting and diarrhoea. Yeah, the vomiting and diarrhoea? That's been for about two weeks. As for vomiting and diarrhoea, I'd say a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.01,
      "end_seconds": 64.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Have you noticed recent infection or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.94,
      "end_seconds": 68.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Ah, no, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.18,
      "end_seconds": 72.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.75,
      "end_seconds": 76.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.08,
      "end_seconds": 79.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.57,
      "end_seconds": 84.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Erm, um, no, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.04,
      "end_seconds": 103.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "So, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.69,
      "end_seconds": 109.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.73,
      "end_seconds": 129.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.62,
      "end_seconds": 134.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.85,
      "end_seconds": 147.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.34,
      "end_seconds": 161.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days. My husband and I live above the shop. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.51,
      "end_seconds": 167.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.64,
      "end_seconds": 179.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.18,
      "end_seconds": 205.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 71, respiratory rate 21, height 177 centimetres. And weight 72 kilos, pulse 106, temp 38.6 degrees, BMI works out to 23.0."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.37,
      "end_seconds": 210.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.14,
      "end_seconds": 213.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Yes, um, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.26,
      "end_seconds": 216.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.27,
      "end_seconds": 241.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "You are hot, shaking, and your pulse is over one hundred and forty and irregular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.72,
      "end_seconds": 260.51,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? It fits best with a thyroid storm. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.54,
      "end_seconds": 265.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Right, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.23,
      "end_seconds": 277.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a thyroid storm, and we'll know more once the an ECG is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.53,
      "end_seconds": 317.25,
      "duration_seconds": 30.72,
      "text": "Let's get an ECG, for fast heart rhythm. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll start you on propranolol, 1 milligrams, now, single dose. That's for thyroid storm. This is an emergency, you will be treated in high dependency. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter. See me again straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.03,
      "end_seconds": 320.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.01,
      "end_seconds": 324.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.41,
      "end_seconds": 327.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}